1
00:00:00,801 --> 00:00:02,891
(Stuart:)...everyone else does too.

2
00:00:03,904 --> 00:00:04,994
(Nerdy guy:)I think you're cool.

3
00:00:06,673 --> 00:00:08,163
(Raj:)Great.

4
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:14,870
I gotta tell you. We've gotta stop
beating ourselves up like this.

5
00:00:16,249 --> 00:00:20,519
(Raj:)Excuse me, everybody.
Can I have your attention, please?

6
00:00:24,691 --> 00:00:29,181
(Raj:)We're all here tonight
because we have no one to be with.

7
00:00:29,463 --> 00:00:34,093
(Raj:)But that doesn't make us mutants.

8
00:00:34,334 --> 00:00:37,034
(Raj:)The only mutants here
are in these comic books.

9
00:00:39,239 --> 00:00:44,699
We gotta stop defining our self-worth
by whether or not we're in a relationship.

10
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:48,609
(Raj:)You know what I see when I look around?

11
00:00:49,416 --> 00:00:51,076
(Raj:)I see a room full of great people.

12
00:00:52,953 --> 00:00:58,023
(Raj:)So let's give ourselves a break.
We are a community.

